      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5469654973308476699\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F92A3.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💣\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Russia has designated me as a “terrorist” for refusing its demands for mass surveillance and censorship on Telegram.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eUnder Russian law, I’m banned from “publishing information on the Internet” \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5289880690408573973\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F988C.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😌\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eRussian officials have clearly got confused about who can ban whom from the Internet  \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5231150324055549453\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9889.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😉\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
